# Nothing here is required. A fresh deploy runs entirely local-first with
# demo mode seeded from synthetic data — zero env vars needed.
#
# These only matter if you opt into the pluggable Supabase persistence
# adapter for multi-device sync. See docs/persistence-adapters.md.
# Never commit a real .env file — it's gitignored on purpose.

# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
